  "Description": "Provides ontology-aware methods for disease and phenotype\nknowledge mining. DOSE supports semantic similarity analysis of\ndisease and phenotype ontology terms, genes, and gene clusters\nusing methods including Resnik, Schlicker, Jiang, Lin, and\nWang. It also provides over-representation analysis and gene\nset enrichment analysis for interpreting gene vectors and\nranked gene lists in disease, phenotype, and cancer contexts.",
